<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76327" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψῐμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψέ</span>) poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψιος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>late,
				slow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρας ὄ.</span>
			<i>for</i> (concerned with) <i>a late time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.325
			</span></i>: in Prose, <i>late in the season</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					17.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, but 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψιος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.9.7
			</span></i>, al.; of crops, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				9.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.433.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				299.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ὀ. τῶν ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑετὸς πρώϊμος καὶ ὄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρὸς -ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFay.</u>
					133.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <i>recent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.674f
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					72.361
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				474.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
			</span></i> ad <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				483
			</span></i>.</div>
